Ravana enters Nikumbhila and embraces sacrificing Meghanada --- Ushanas lists seven sacrifices and Shiva boons --- Ravana scolds honoring foes and leads household home --- Vibhishana rebukes seizure of wailing women --- Vibhishana reveals Madhu stole Kumbhinasi slaying ministers --- Ravana musters vast host for Madhu and heaven --- Vibhishana stays in Lanka practicing dharma --- Kumbhinasi begs life of husband and wins pardon --- Madhu honors Ravana and joins heaven campaign at Kailasa
